  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience durability with Rothco's BDU Shirt, crafted from robust Rip-Stop material. Reinforced elbows ensure longevity, and the adjustable button tab cuff offers a personalized fit. This uniform shirt features four large button-down bellowed pockets, a practical pencil pocket, and a button-down front with flap closure. Rothco's BDU Shirt combines functionality with a rugged style, making it the ideal choice for those seeking durability and utility in a classic button-down.</p>",
